  "reference": "Eklizia 1",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe pa Jayerlembe, ma wod Daudi, m’ubimo i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ma ie nanu mi gin ma ie nanu Jayerlembe wacu; gin ma ie nanu mi gin ma ie nanu, gin ceke en e gin ma ie nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu bedo ku kuloka ang’o mi tic mi muli pare ceke m’emule ko the ceng’i? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanum’utuk acel cidho, man dhanum’utuk mange bino; ento ng’om bedo mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ bende wok, e ceng’ mwony, man ecidho pio i kakare ka m’eai i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamu cidho yor ariwa ma piny, man elokre yor ariwa ma malu; elokre aloka thiri thiri ku woth pare, man yamu dwogo kendo i awirawira pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ma dongo ceke mol i nam, ento nam pong’ ungo: ka ma kulo ma dongo cidho i ie, gicidho keca kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ceke pong’ ku olo; dhanu copo yero maeni ngo: wang’ yeng’ ungo ku neno, kadi ith de pong’ ungo ku winjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin m’ubedo nuti e ma bibedo nuti; man gin m’utimbre e ma bitimbre: e gin moko mbe ma nyen the ceng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin moko nuti ma jucopo wacu pire kumae, Nen, maeni nyeni? egamu bedo nuti con, i nindo m’ular ubedo nuti iwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poi mi dhanum’utuk ma kwong’a mbe; kadok poi moko mi dhanum’utuk ma cen ma bibino de bibedo mbe, i kind ju ma biwok ma cen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Jayerlembe abedo ni ubimo wi Israel i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aketho adundena kara asai ayeny de ku rieko pi gin ceke m’utimbre the polo: en e sendri ma dit ma Mungu mio ni wot dhanu gisendri ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneno tic ceke m’utimbre the ceng’; man, nen, gin ceke ie nanu man kethocwiny kum yamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin m’ugom dwokre atira ngo; man gin m’umbe kwandre ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.29+1KI.4.30+1KI.4.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 4:29-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweco kud adundena gira, awacu kumae, Nen, agamu ira rieko ma dit ma sagu dhanu ceke m’ular ubedo nuti ira i Yerusalem; eyo, adundena mulo rieko ku ng’eyong’ec dit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aketho adundena kara ang’ei rieko, man kara ang’ei abelu man lem ma kite mbe: aneno nia maeni bende en e kethocwiny kum yamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum can ma dit ni i rieko ma dit; man ng’atu ma medo ng’eyong’ec emedo can.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
